                                                "sense_id": "2dec3a03-a77e-3fd3-a575-52c5542aa9e3",
                                                "text": "This was accomplished in the old system by polling a software variable representing the number of prebleach bin and issuing a software command to trigger the AOM once the variable has countdowned to zero."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37e5bf32-7cd6-4640-a9f5-7827da4c600e",
                                                "sense_id": "2dec3a03-a77e-3fd3-a575-52c5542aa9e3",
                                                "text": "Time measures itself out in a series of diminishing peristaltic ticks, countdowning slowly towards the miracle of Ignition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67d48382-f693-4432-ad8b-f340c0ffc118",
                                                "sense_id": "2dec3a03-a77e-3fd3-a575-52c5542aa9e3",
                                                "text": "Whole families stood gawking at the massive statue, countdowning the five remaining minutes to the big one."
